u we'll have more on this  story throughout the afternoon  sakirshama saying he will resign as  labour leader if he is issued with a  fixed penalty notice by durham police  for breaking covid rules laws as they  were at the time  now president putin today attempted to  justify his assault on ukraine claiming  it is a forced response to western plans  to invade russia speaking at the  country's annual vic

